  "query_preview": "../ Monday to Friday / A short wave moves to the SE AK\narea with a frontal band moving to the northeast gulf coast and\nthen the panhandle through Monday and Tuesday. With an upper level\nhigh over the central pacific the flow pattern weather is looking\nmore zonal from the just south of the Aleutians to the northern\npanhandle for the later half of the week. So expect the continued\nonshore flow to maintain the rain anticipated across the region.\n24 hour rain totals in the 3/4 inch to 1.5 inch range, and\nmodels beginning to suggest a wave a bit further south with\namounts focused over the southern third of the panhandle, for the\nThursday to Friday timeframe.",
